  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "# Given a Shopper is logged in and belongs to a VIC customer group, when they view a product on PLP, then standard pricing is displayed with no group discount applied.\n# Given a Shopper is logged in and belongs to a VIC customer group, when they view a product on PDP, then standard pricing is displayed with no group discount applied.\n# Given a Shopper is logged in and belongs to a VIC customer group, when they add an eligible product to cart, then the item displays Was/Now pricing with an \"X% off applied\" label beneath it.\n# Given a Shopper is logged in and belongs to a VIC customer group, when they add a non-eligible product to cart (e.g. new season), then the item displays at full price with no Was/Now pricing and no discount label.\n# Given a Shopper is logged in and belongs to a VIC customer group, when they view cart, then a basket summary discount line is shown displaying the promotion name, discount percentage, and discount amount.\n# Given a Shopper is logged in and belongs to a VIC customer group, when the basket summary discount line is displayed, then no Remove action is shown on that line.\n# Given a Shopper is logged in and belongs to a VIC customer group, when they proceed to checkout, then the Was/Now line item pricing and basket summary discount line are carried through and displayed at checkout.\n# Given a Shopper is logged in and belongs to a VIC customer group, when they view a product that is already on sale, then the sale price is displayed in cart with no additional group discount applied.\n# Given a Shopper is logged in and belongs to a VIC customer group, when they view a gift card product, then standard pricing is displayed in cart with no group discount applied.\n# Given a Shopper is not logged in, when they browse the storefront, then standard pricing is displayed on PLP, PDP, in cart and checkout with no group discount applied."
  }
}"}

