  "customfield_10231": {
    "value": "# Given a catalogue price rule promotion is active and a Shopper is not logged in, when they browse the applicable storefront, then standard pricing is displayed on PLP, PDP, cart, and checkout with no promotional discount applied.\n# Given a catalogue price rule promotion is active and a Shopper logs in, when they view a product on PLP, then Was/Now pricing is displayed on the product card.\n# Given a catalogue price rule promotion is active and a Shopper logs in, when they view a product on PDP, then Was/Now pricing is displayed.\n# Given a catalogue price rule promotion is active and a Shopper logs in, when they add a product to cart, then Was/Now pricing is displayed on the cart line item, and a promotional label (e.g. \"Private Sale — 20% Off Applied\") is shown beneath the item.\n# Given a catalogue price rule promotion is active and a Shopper proceeds to checkout, when they view the order summary, then Was/Now pricing is displayed per line item and the promotional label is shown.\n# Given a catalogue price rule promotion is active and a Shopper views a product already on standard sale, when they view PLP or PDP, then the sale price is displayed and no additional catalogue promotion discount is applied.\n# Given a catalogue price rule promotion is active and a Shopper views a gift card product when logged in, then standard pricing is displayed with no promotional discount applied."
